---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Things to Do in Antalya"
pageDescription: "Ancient ruins, turquoise beaches, an old Roman harbor and more — your complete guide to things to do in Antalya, Turkey."
pageUrl: "/things-to-do/"
ogImage: "/images/photos/things-to-do-cover.jpg"
permalink: "/things-to-do/index.html"
schema:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "CollectionPage"
  name: "Things to Do in Antalya"
  url: "https://travel-antalya.com/things-to-do/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% set items = collections.thingsToDo %}
{% set hotels = collections.hotels %}

<section class="listing-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Explore</span>
    <h1>Things to Do in Antalya</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width:640px;">Dive into ancient ruins, turquoise water and a walled old town that's been welcoming travelers since Roman times.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    <p>In Antalya, the possibilities go far beyond the beach. Whether you're drawn to <strong>ancient history</strong>, eager to explore a <strong>Roman-era old town</strong>, or seeking a cool escape at a waterfall inland, there's something for every kind of traveler here.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint" style="padding-top:40px;">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Ancient Ruins</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.7rem;">2,000 years of history, still standing</h2>
      <p>The Antalya region has some of the best-preserved Roman and Hellenistic sites anywhere in the Mediterranean. Aspendos Theatre still has its original acoustics; Perge and Termessos reward anyone willing to make the short drive inland.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-media" style="aspect-ratio:4/3; border-radius:6px;">
      <img src="/images/photos/things-to-do-cover.jpg" alt="Ancient ruins near Antalya">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:40px;">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="card-media" style="aspect-ratio:4/3; border-radius:6px; order:2;">
      <img src="/images/photos/antalya-coastline.jpg" alt="Kaleiçi old town, Antalya">
    </div>
    <div style="order:1;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Old Town &amp; Culture</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.7rem;">Kaleiçi: a walled town around a Roman harbor</h2>
      <p>Narrow cobblestone lanes, restored Ottoman houses and a small working harbor make Kaleiçi worth a full day on its own — more once you add in the Yivli Minare and the old bazaar streets.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ EXPLORE THINGS TO DO (horizontal listing, CMS-driven) ============ -->
<section class="tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Explore</span>
        <h2>Explore Things to Do in Antalya</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="filter-bar">
      <span class="filter-pill">Old Town</span>
      <span class="filter-pill">Nature</span>
      <span class="filter-pill">Ancient Ruins</span>
      <span class="filter-pill">Beaches</span>
      <span class="filter-pill">Nightlife</span>
    </div>
    <p class="results-count">Showing {{ items.length }} things to do</p>

    {% for item in items %}
    <div class="listing-row">
      <div class="listing-row-media">
        <img src="{{ item.data.cover }}" alt="{{ item.data.title }}">
      </div>
      <div class="listing-row-body">
        <div class="listing-row-top">
          <div>
            <span class="badge badge-verified">{{ item.data.category }}</span>
            <h3 class="listing-row-title"><a href="/things-to-do/{{ item.data.title | slugify }}/">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h3>
          </div>
          <a href="/things-to-do/{{ item.data.title | slugify }}/" class="listing-row-arrow">↗</a>
        </div>
        <p class="listing-row-excerpt">{{ item.data.excerpt }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOTELS (pulled live from the hotels collection) ============ -->
<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Places to Stay</span>
        <h2>Hotels near everything on this page</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/hotels/" class="see-all">See all hotels →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for hotel in hotels %}
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-media">
          {% if hotel.data.tags and "sponsored" in hotel.data.tags %}<span class="card-tag">Sponsored</span>{% endif %}
          <img src="{{ hotel.data.cover }}" alt="{{ hotel.data.title }}">
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3><a href="/hotels/{{ hotel.data.title | slugify }}/" style="color:inherit;">{{ hotel.data.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ hotel.data.excerpt }}</p>
          <span class="card-meta">{{ hotel.data.neighborhood }} · {{ hotel.data.price }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
